{
  "schema_version": "0.1",
  "id": "streamsim/motor-drive",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Variable-frequency motor drive",
  "description": "Induction motor on a frequency converter: speed follows the setpoint through the drive ramp, shaft power is torque times speed, and the current follows the power. Winding temperature heats with the square of the current and runs away above a threshold. Overload and over-temperature trip and stay tripped until reset.",
